{"id":125235,"vol":{"id":20186,"name":"Annihilation: Ronan"},"num":"2","name":"","title":"Annihilation: Ronan #2","year":"2006","date":"2006-07-31","store":"2006-05-24","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/77/329420-20186-125235-1-annihilation-ronan.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/77/329420-20186-125235-1-annihilation-ronan.jpg","pub":"Marvel","deck":"","desc":"Godthab Omega: a nothing planet in a backwater bit of the cosmos. Right? Wrong. In fact, something is very wrong on Godthab, a malign presence drawing in cosmic entities like flies to a web. Ronan's been snagged too, and he's not happy about it. In fact, he's going to do something about it... right after he deals with the \"deadliest woman in the Universe,\" Gamora! And, as if that impending confrontation weren't enough to shake Godthab to its core, here comes the Annihilation Wave...","people":[{"id":41783,"name":"Andy Schmidt","role":"editor"},{"id":42410,"name":"Aubrey Sitterson","role":"editor"},{"id":2270,"name":"Dave McCaig","role":"colorist"},{"id":41850,"name":"Gabriele Dell'Otto","role":"cover"},{"id":41553,"name":"Joe Caramagna","role":"letterer"},{"id":1537,"name":"Joe Quesada","role":"editor"},{"id":4990,"name":"Jorge Lucas","role":"penciler, inker"},{"id":41683,"name":"Molly Lazer","role":"editor"},{"id":42097,"name":"Simon Furman","role":"writer"}],"chars":[{"id":4818,"name":"Ronan","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/0/77/76824-82805-ronan.jpg"},{"id":6806,"name":"Gamora","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/9357825-ezgif-7-563a93dc1b.jpg"},{"id":14691,"name":"Cerise","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11112/111123579/8305190-cerise_%28earth-616%29_from_mr._and_mrs._x_vol_1_3_002.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":41287,"name":"\"Marvel Cosmic\" Annihilation"}]}